<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <title>Orchestrator Portal</title>
    @* Geist, as Atlas loads it. The stack in --font-sans falls back to system-ui, so a CSP or an
       air-gapped network that blocks fonts.googleapis.com degrades the type rather than the layout.
       Self-host under wwwroot/fonts if that fallback ever becomes the normal case. *@
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
        rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["css/atlas.css"]" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
